OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt the Shirley B&B in Bournemouth,
OL,7,     FJorge is proud of his powerful
OL,8,     Fshowers, which Martyn and Elaine
OL,9,     Fexperience first-hand, thanks to
OL,10,     Fan accidental demonstration.
OL,11,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,13,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,14,     Ffor the last time. There are harsh
OL,15,     Ftruths, heated debates and
OL,16,     Fdownright disagreements before the
OL,17,     Fwinner is announced.
